# NOTE: _internal/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# This repo (3idhMind/pdflyly) is PRIVATE, so internal docs are safe here and
# get version history + off-machine backup for free. The PUBLIC repo is a
# separate one (3idhMind/pdfly), synced manually — when syncing, do not copy
# _internal/ across, and never push this repo's git history to it.
# See _internal/DECISIONS.md D-008.
